<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>三项目技术雷达汇总任务包</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f4f6f8;color:#17252e;font:15px/1.6 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}header{background:#152f3b;color:white;padding:40px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1320px)/2))}h1{font-size:32px;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:.5px}header p{max-width:1050px;color:#dbe9ed;margin:6px 0}.wrap{max-width:1370px;padding:26px;margin:auto}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #e0e6e9;padding:19px;border-radius:10px}.card strong{display:block;font-size:32px;line-height:1.15;color:#165e68}.card span{color:#657780}.notice{background:#fff7e5;border-left:4px solid #d69925;padding:15px 20px;margin:22px 0}.links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}a{color:#156576;text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.links a{background:white;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #dae4e8;border-radius:6px}.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:22px 0 12px}input,select{font:inherit;border:1px solid #cad6dc;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 12px;background:white}input{flex:1;min-width:260px}.tablebox{overflow:auto;background:white;border:1px solid #dde5e9;border-radius:8px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}th{background:#eaf0f3;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}th,td{padding:11px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid #e6ecee;vertical-align:top}small{display:block;color:#71828b;font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.badge{display:inline-block;background:#fff0ce;color:#805514;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap}.muted{color:#62757e}footer{margin:24px 0;color:#687b84;font-size:13px}h2{font-size:21px;margin:30px 0 12px}@media(max-width:700px){.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}h1{font-size:24px}.wrap{padding:15px}header{padding:26px 20px}}</style><header><h1>三项目技术雷达 · 汇总与资格任务包</h1><p>ArcheAxis · WORK-LAB · DESIGN-LAB　｜　2026-09-15</p><p>把历史发现合并为可审计候选和有限资格任务，不把热度、重复报警或建议当成已完成集成。</p></header><main class="wrap"><div class="cards"><div class="card"><strong>30</strong><span>历史报告轮次</span></div><div class="card"><strong>81 + 59</strong><span>重点候选 + 监控对照</span></div><div class="card"><strong>25</strong><span>去重任务：3前置 + 22领域</span></div><div class="card"><strong>0</strong><span>自动集成 · 仓库改动</span></div></div><div class="notice"><strong>证据状态：</strong>本页数值只保留历史报告说法，不是本轮GitHub快照。全部外部事实待核验；本包没有重新联网扫描、执行候选或审计项目远端代码。</div><p class="notice">这是独立候选浏览页，候选详情可直接打开。任务文档与校验请解压总包后使用目录入口。</p><h2>建议首批：各一个真实闭环</h2><p>先完成G00来源核验、G01真实仓库对照、G02环境授权。随后选择A01互动学习、W09代码审查、D01可编辑设计工作台。每项先一个主候选与一个对照；其他任务按收益后置。</p><p class="muted">DESIGN-LAB保持独立运行；WORK-LAB与ArcheAxis为可选接口，不成为安装、启动、测试或恢复前置。</p><h2>候选总账</h2><div class="controls"><input id="q" placeholder="搜索名称、仓库、任务或能力"><select id="project"><option value="">所有项目</option><option>ArcheAxis</option><option>WORK-LAB</option><option>DESIGN-LAB</option></select><select id="kind"><option value="">所有记录性质</option><option>历史重点候选</option><option>监控或比较对象</option></select></div><p id="count" class="muted">140项</p><div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>名称 / 历史仓库位置</th><th>主归属</th><th>能力层</th><th>分类</th><th>任务</th><th>历史星标说法</th><th>证据</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-project='WORK-LAB' data-kind='历史重点候选' data-group='协议与会话'><td><a href='05_WORK-LAB/候选卡/C001_MCP.md'>C001</a></td><td><strong>MCP</strong><small>modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol</small></td><td>WORK-LAB</td><td>协议与会话</td><td>继续观察</td><td>W01</td><td>约9.2千</td><td><span class='badge'>待核验</span></td></tr><tr data-project='WORK-LAB' data-kind='历史重点候选' data-group='协议与会话'><td><a href='05_WORK-LAB/候选卡/C002_ACP.md'>C002</a></td><td><strong>ACP</strong><small>agentclientprotocol/agent-client-protocol</small></td><td>WORK-LAB</td><td>协议与会话</td><td>概念验证</td><td>W01</td><td>约4.2千</td><td><span class='badge'>待核验</span></td></tr><tr data-p